  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Counter Threat Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will deliver training and mentoring on the disruption of criminal and conflict financing in priority countries in order to assist them to reduce threats to national and regional security and stability.The focus is on reducing risks to national and regional security and economies by assisting States to enhance their ability to use counter threat finance investigation and disruption tools.</narrative>
  </description>
